[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 486.71, "timestamp": "00:08:06", "text": "我想给你看这条推文，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 491.67, "timestamp": "00:08:11", "text": "登录手续太麻烦了。 快点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 495.67, "timestamp": "00:08:15", "text": "我忘了登出账号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 510.39, "timestamp": "00:08:30", "text": "我再补充一点，这样你们就能看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 517.19, "timestamp": "00:08:37", "text": "等等，我们该怎么办？ 哦，窗口捕获。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 524.47, "timestamp": "00:08:44", "text": "纠正我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 529.03, "timestamp": "00:08:49", "text": "是的，正如推文所说。 嗯，等等，让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 531.91, "timestamp": "00:08:51", "text": "调整一下大小。 抱歉，袖口有点问题。 是的。 所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 535.11, "timestamp": "00:08:55", "text": "如果你不知道的话，去年我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 538.949, "timestamp": "00:08:58", "text": "向 Quero 游戏抱怨，因为"}]